OL,3,AJulio Iglesias facing court
OL,4,Ainvestigation over alleged sexual
OL,5,Aoffences
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe announcement comes after Spanish
OL,8,Fprosecutors dropped an inquiry into the
OL,9,Fclaims earlier this year after
OL,10,Fconcluding that they lacked
OL,11,Fjurisdiction because the alleged crimes
OL,12,Ftook place abroad.
OL,14,FIglesias, who has been a household name
OL,15,Fin Spain since the 1960s and has sold
OL,16,Fmillions of records worldwide, has
OL,17,Fpreviously denied the allegations.
